# Scenario 'register_hidden_manual': initial registration with B+SELECT+RIGHT held on the first A (as 'register_hidden') but the hidden step
# 電話番号入力方法選択 is answered with the SECOND entry 手動で入力する: explanation page, Internet phone number keypad (digits 1 2 5), pager
# number keypad, comment keyboard (typed 'A'; B backspaces with text on each of the three input screens, and B on the empty first keypad goes back to the explanation page), then the normal password / summary / dial / POP3 check / welcome sequence. 'register_hidden'
# took the automatic entry, so 65:44EA -> 65:44ED (Registration_ManualPhoneEntry) and the keypad/comment screens were never entered
# during registration. Blank cartridge and blank adapter, fake Internet. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400                     # boot: adapter check ("モバイルアダプタGBをチェックしています")
gap 20
taplen 30
tap A+B+SELECT+RIGHT         # "初期登録開始" with the hidden combination held
taplen 4
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "初期登録のご注意" 1/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # 2/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # 3/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "料金のご注意"
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "ログインID入力" example screen
waitstable 40 max 200
shot login_id_keypad
tap A x10                    # 10 digits '1' -> field full, auto-advances to mail address
waitstable 40 max 200
shot mail_intro
tap A
waitstable 40 max 100
tap A x8                     # local part (8 chars) ...
tap A x4                     # ... then sub-domain part (4 chars) -> cursor jumps to OK
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 40 max 200
shot phone_method
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A                        # 手動で入力する
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # explanation
waitstable 40 max 200
shot manual_keypad_1
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap B                        # backspace with a digit on the line, twice (the second one empties the line)
tap B
tap B                        # B on the empty line: back to the explanation page
waitstable 40 max 200
shot manual_keypad_back
tap A
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap DOWN
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 40 max 200
shot manual_keypad_2
tap A
tap DOWN
tap RIGHT
tap A
tap B
tap B
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 40 max 200
shot manual_comment_intro
tap A
waitstable 40 max 200
shot manual_comment_kb
tap A x2
tap B                        # backspace with text in the comment field
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 40 max 200
shot manual_password_intro
shot password_intro
tap A
waitstable 40 max 100
# password "aZ01": a, Z, 0, 1
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START                    # jump to OK
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot password_confirm
# re-enter the same password
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot password_save_confirm
tap A                        # "はい" (save password)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot register_summary
tap A                        # "はい"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot connect_confirm
tap A                        # "はい": dial DION (#9677), PPP, DNS, POP3 login check
wait 600
waitstable 60 max 900
shot registration_result
wait 300
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot welcome_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot welcome_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_welcome_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_welcome_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_welcome_3
